  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAME NGO development project Lebanon&#x2019;s Youth Building Dreams 2021 -2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAME - NGO call Lebanon - 2021-2023 - Expanding civic space in Lebanon by empowering youth to take a leadership role in advocating for creating and activating open, inclusive and safe public meeting spaces in the local communities, while strengthening social cohesion through youth-led street sport and culture activities to bridge children and youth of different gender, nationality and background.</narrative>
  </description>
